{
  "name": "Soll ich raus für Aurora?",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "http:MakeRequest",
      "version": 4,
      "parameters": {
        "tlsType": "",
        "authenticationType": "noAuth"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://services.swpc.noaa.gov/products/summary/solar-wind-mag-field.json",
        "method": "get",
        "shareCookies": false,
        "parseResponse": true,
        "allowRedirects": true,
        "stopOnHttpError": true,
        "requestCompressedContent": true
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": -368,
          "y": 4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "module": "http:MakeRequest",
      "version": 4,
      "filter": {
        "name": "Bz negative",
        "conditions": [
          [
            {
              "a": "{{parseNumber(2.data[1].bz_gsm)}}",
              "b": "-3",
              "o": "number:less"
            },
            {
              "a": "{{parseNumber(2.data[1].bz_gsm)}}",
              "b": "-100",
              "o": "number:greater"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      "parameters": {
        "tlsType": "",
        "authenticationType": "noAuth"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://services.swpc.noaa.gov/products/summary/solar-wind-speed.json",
        "method": "get",
        "shareCookies": false,
        "parseResponse": true,
        "allowRedirects": true,
        "stopOnHttpError": true,
        "requestCompressedContent": true
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": -46,
          "y": -3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
      "version": 1,
      "filter": {
        "name": "Speed OK",
        "conditions": [
          [
            {
              "a": "{{parseNumber(7.data[1].proton_speed)}}",
              "b": "450",
              "o": "number:greater"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "mapper": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_PRIVATE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "🚨🌌 AURORA ALERT — GO OUTSIDE!\n\n⏱ It should start within 30–60 minutes.\nDress warmly, this takes more than five minutes.\n\n🧭 Look NORTH\nAway from street lights. At first you will only see a grey band above the horizon — that is it. The green colour appears when it gets strong, or on camera.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🚪 Door to the atmosphere: {{if(parseNumber(2.data[1].bz_gsm) < -10; \"WIDE OPEN\"; \"open\")}}\n({{2.data[1].bz_gsm}} nT — the more negative, the better)\n\n💨 Solar wind: {{if(parseNumber(7.data[1].proton_speed) > 600; \"very fast\"; if(parseNumber(7.data[1].proton_speed) > 500; \"fast\"; \"normal\"))}}\n({{7.data[1].proton_speed}} km/s)\n\n🔋 Power reserve: {{if(parseNumber(2.data[1].bt) > 15; \"large — it may get even stronger, check again in half an hour\"; if(parseNumber(2.data[1].bt) > 8; \"medium\"; \"small — it won't get much stronger\"))}}\n({{2.data[1].bt}} nT)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📷 Photo: 5–10 s exposure, ISO 1600, manual focus at ∞, tripod is a must.",
        "parseMode": "",
        "replyMarkup": "",
        "messageThreadId": "",
        "replyToMessageId": "",
        "replyMarkupAssembleType": "reply_markup_enter"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 263,
          "y": -7
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "module": "telegram:SendReplyMessage",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "mapper": {
        "chatId": "@YOUR_PUBLIC_CHANNEL",
        "text": "(same template as module 6)",
        "parseMode": "",
        "replyMarkup": "",
        "messageThreadId": "",
        "replyToMessageId": "",
        "replyMarkupAssembleType": "reply_markup_enter"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 563,
          "y": -7
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "dlq": false,
      "slots": null,
      "dataloss": false,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "freshVariables": false,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true
    }
  },
  "scheduling": {
    "type": "indefinitely",
    "interval": 1800,
    "restrict": [
      {
        "days": [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ],
        "time": [
          "20:00",
          "23:59"
        ]
      },
      {
        "days": [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ],
        "time": [
          "00:00",
          "06:00"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
